{"name": "DIVE or DIE - Children of Rain", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"304\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/d167ef7ad5e3d85cb76bc27ebac7a8d1.avif?t=1785164308\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Abyssal Pool, an underwater labyrinth of drowned ruins, lost idols, and mutated monsters. Lead a band of desperate survivors with Jack, a haunted man with a singular purpose: to save what's left of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade or fight what lurks in the dark. And try to appease the Maker of Rain before he floods the world in his black tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/e9c0595bad2fc256f0fa579299aafbfa.poster.avif?t=1785164308\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/e9c0595bad2fc256f0fa579299aafbfa.webm?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/e9c0595bad2fc256f0fa579299aafbfa.mp4?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunge into the cursed Abyssal Pool, where every descent is a deadly gamble. Navigate sunken ruins, face eldritch horrors in darkness, and race against dwindling oxygen. Knowledge and skill are your only guides in the challenging depths.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"274\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/c7ed8553f05aa21974ad8d3a02e13870.poster.avif?t=1785164308\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/c7ed8553f05aa21974ad8d3a02e13870.webm?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/c7ed8553f05aa21974ad8d3a02e13870.mp4?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead desperate survivors where death is permanent and sacrifice is inevitable. Manage health and sanity. Decide who joins, who dives, who dies. No One is safe<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"282\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/f4a28735e72469f7eb71908278969131.poster.avif?t=1785164308\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/f4a28735e72469f7eb71908278969131.webm?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/f4a28735e72469f7eb71908278969131.mp4?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform your fragile camp into humanity's last refuge. Assign vital roles to your survivors, improve their skillset and craft them new tools &amp; equipment. Balance resources against time to upgrade essential structures. A stronger camp means deeper dives and better chances of surviving another day.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"268\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/08ad05a256c271f3137d06cb5e7b0eb7.poster.avif?t=1785164308\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/08ad05a256c271f3137d06cb5e7b0eb7.webm?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/08ad05a256c271f3137d06cb5e7b0eb7.mp4?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for sacred relics scattered across the drowned world. Find them all before the final Flood drowns everything forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is running out; every day matters. Will you find redemption in the depths, or join the countless souls already claimed by the Black Rain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"258\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/f7b6583e3ed45dd69167b944fb4914d7.avif?t=1785164308\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Every descent is a deadly gamble. DIVE or DIE in the cursed abyss, face Eldritch horrors to uncover the mystery of the black rain. Scavenge and upgrade, recruit and sacrifice. Save your camp... The Flood is coming.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/e0279893a393cecd472e1475d16ddb648aad15a3/header.jpg?t=1785164308", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Underwater", "Exploration", "Lovecraftian", "Horror", "Action-Adventure", "Survival Horror"], "developers": "Drop Rate Studio", "publishers": "Drop Rate Studio", "release_date": "Jul 21, 2026", "price": "$17.99", "appid": "3590290", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "21 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bP5UGrUBjrU", "first_seen": 1784592000.0}